{"layout":"organizationStructure","root":{"data":{"text":"<p>  Raw extracellular signal  </p>","note":"解码算法真正需要的是能够稳定表征神经活动的特征","generalization":[],"expand":true,"uid":"b8df761d-5d81-4d50-9ab9-abd4694f7e68","richText":true,"isActive":false,"imgMap":{"smm_img_key_6ee81ad9-3180-432d-a8a6-0f39959a31d3":"data:image/png;base64,","smm_img_key_7cd16d55-788c-49ee-af55-12a991bf9e37":"data:image/png;base64,","smm_img_key_ae9fa2aa-bb9e-4019-ad89-eff98b739254":"data:image/png;base64,","smm_img_key_5f90a586-ecba-4e9a-bbe7-35b726c52ee1":"data:image/png;base64,","smm_img_key_b5f51180-2fda-4fb9-b189-970effdda35c":"data:image/png;base64,","smm_img_key_8774824c-8a64-421a-a4d2-62645cc640af":"data:image/png;base64,","smm_img_key_6fed084b-edce-4e7e-a1ae-ba79d55d86a3":"data:image/png;base64,","smm_img_key_c83597a4-3d79-49f1-8bf7-409ec25bc809":"data:image/png;base64,","smm_img_key_f828e706-80be-4c0c-9611-147a0d5a5e76":"data:image/png;base64,"},"image":"smm_img_key_5f90a586-ecba-4e9a-bbe7-35b726c52ee1","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":590.857177734375,"height":70.70085887419872,"custom":true},"imgPlacement":"bottom","attachmentUrl":"","attachmentName":"","freeNodeTrees":[]},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>Highpass filter (&gt;250 Hz)</p>","generalization":[],"uid":"d95b501a-7537-48e1-83de-c3ced9bc781b","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false,"image":"smm_img_key_b5f51180-2fda-4fb9-b189-970effdda35c","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":551.4296197086069,"height":146.95599365234375,"custom":true},"imgPlacement":"bottom"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>Spike detection</p>","generalization":[],"uid":"ec764af7-2cc9-4ecb-b44e-678e9d4be6cc","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>Spike sorting</p>","note":"锋电位分类（即Spike Sorting） 的核心目标是精准提取单神经元活动（即哪个神经元在什么时间放电），尽可能恢复每个神经元的放电序列，从而获得更高质量、更有信息量的神经编码特征，供后续解码算法使用。","generalization":[{"expand":true,"isActive":false,"text":"<p>1.耗时：高通量几个小时数据：sorting跑几十分钟甚至几小时</p><p>2.漂移：神经元位置每天都会变，长期稳定性差</p><p>3.Online困难：BCL需要毫秒级(20-150 ms)内完成解码</p>","range":null,"uid":"5efce236-c136-40a0-bad1-d804510903f8","richText":true}],"uid":"3b4f4e88-b394-4f99-a416-6651aa9e0821","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false,"image":"smm_img_key_6ee81ad9-3180-432d-a8a6-0f39959a31d3","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":130.94464111328125,"height":378.4300128173828,"custom":true},"imgPlacement":"right"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>Single-unit spike trains</p>","note":"SU","generalization":[],"uid":"7f78bc8e-317c-47b5-8006-474704f445b6","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false,"image":"smm_img_key_7cd16d55-788c-49ee-af55-12a991bf9e37","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":351.4705810546875,"height":84.15492785816461,"custom":true},"imgPlacement":"bottom"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>Spike count / firing rate</p>","generalization":[],"uid":"34d9c64f-7381-4280-a8f8-901a8b9d5713","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false,"image":"smm_img_key_ae9fa2aa-bb9e-4019-ad89-eff98b739254","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":345.7227783203125,"height":371.4680915994847,"custom":true},"imgPlacement":"bottom"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>Feature extraction</p>","generalization":[],"uid":"37acfa4b-dc94-4c51-a912-5b1ae2aed828","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>Population activity matrix</p>","generalization":[],"uid":"3794cb99-f3b4-4a53-8454-b3082766fbf6","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>LR / SVM / LSTM / Transformer / Deep Decoder</p>","generalization":[],"uid":"ff37159d-3774-49a1-9e80-737ea53fc4ec","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>Behavior / Movement / State prediction</p>","generalization":[],"uid":"5db41865-c4a9-4387-ba25-4b60283287ff","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>Multi-unit activity (MUA)</p>","generalization":[{"expand":true,"isActive":false,"text":"<p>没有neuron，只有channel，速度快，实时性高</p>","range":null,"uid":"40f4b7c8-4271-4601-addc-0ebdc3185e04","richText":true}],"uid":"3673605e-3aa3-4ad2-9397-cfe3e80c577d","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>Spike count / firing rate（Threshold crossing）</p>","generalization":[],"uid":"d194e6fa-4565-4fac-bac6-f776e5b1dad2","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>Feature extraction</p>","generalization":[],"uid":"e84a3c2b-00a1-4d59-a37a-0dfa714b5db6","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>Population activity matrix</p>","generalization":[],"uid":"5255fbee-3f70-4b2c-a5d2-fc1bd026a61f","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>LR / SVM / LSTM / Transformer / Deep Decoder</p>","generalization":[],"uid":"728a8179-9b95-4273-aaed-c2c86e70a8f1","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>Behavior / Movement / State prediction</p>","generalization":[],"uid":"e6cbdbeb-3f85-4e65-b222-ce76abd259e6","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>Lowpass filter (&lt;250 Hz)</p>","generalization":[{"expand":true,"isActive":false,"text":"<p>与ECoG、EEG类似，信号较为稳定，如很多运动想象BCI</p>","range":null,"uid":"77938f04-90da-4c1a-9c07-4d49151a1245","richText":true}],"uid":"67b26723-d073-42af-8a59-8310efe40a18","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false,"image":"smm_img_key_8774824c-8a64-421a-a4d2-62645cc640af","imageTitle":"","imageSize":{"width":286.75496688741725,"height":50,"custom":true},"imgPlacement":"bottom"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>LFP decoder</p>","generalization":[],"uid":"099dcb2d-89ea-45d3-96ca-be9d9f490c4b","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>ERP</p>","generalization":[],"uid":"7af36bbc-1458-4683-99d0-df2b2f1ba656","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false,"image":"smm_img_key_6fed084b-edce-4e7e-a1ae-ba79d55d86a3","imageTitle"